  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRHR insats, RFSU</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRHR support, RFSU - SRHR new contribution with NGO/INGO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project vision
All in Liberia are free to decide over body and sexuality regardless of power and wealth.
Project long term outcomes
-Liberian laws and policy frameworks for sexual rights, safe abortion and CSE have improved
-Increased awareness of sexual rights, safe abortion and CSE among Liberians
-Changes in social norms have resulted in more positive attitudes and beliefs about sexual rights and safe abotion.
Project outcome:
Liberian civil&#xa0; society organisations have:
-advanced SRHR
-increased knowledge and awareness about bodily autonomy, sexuality and rights among Liberian youth, women and LGBTI people as well as relevant stakeholders
-been vocal in claiming SRHR</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RFSUs insats &quot;Amplying Voices - Civil Society Network Actions for Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights&quot; har en aktivitetsperiod som str&#xe4;cker sig fr&#xe5;n augusti 2021 till december 2024 med en total budget p&#xe5; 21 635 000 SEK. Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att alla i Liberia &#xe4;r fria att best&#xe4;mma &#xf6;ver sin kropp och sexualitet oavsett makt och rikedom. Insatsens delm&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att Civila samh&#xe4;llsorganisationer i Liberia har &#xf6;kad kunskap och medvetenhet om kroppslig autonomi, sexualitet och r&#xe4;ttigheter hos ungdomar, kvinnor och HBTQ -personer. Vidare f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas dessa organisaioner att &#xf6;ka sin genomslagskraft g&#xe4;llande SRHR. Ambassaden bed&#xf6;mmer att insatsen har integrerat f&#xf6;ljande perspektiv i projektf&#xf6;rslaget; fattigdom, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, k&#xf6;n samt konflikt. Insatsen bed&#xf6;ms inte ha n&#xe5;gon st&#xf6;rre milj&#xf6;- och klimatp&#xe5;verkan men milj&#xf6; och klimat kommer att vara en dialogfr&#xe5;ga som ambasaden kommer att f&#xf6;ra med RFSU och dess genomf&#xf6;randepartners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed contribution &apos;Amplying Voices - Civil Society Network Taking Action for Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights&apos; is a&#xa0; project by RFSU running from August 2021 - December 2024 with a total contribution of SEK 21 635 000. The project has an overall goal &apos;All in Liberia are free to decide over body and sexuality regardless of power and wealth&apos; and a specific objectives &apos;Liberian Civil Society Organization: have advanced SRHR; increased knowledge and awareness about bodily autonomy, sexuality and rights among Liberia youth, women and LGBTI people as well as relevant stakeholders; become vocal in claiming SRHR. The project was assessed to have sufficiently integrated the poverty human rights, gender and conflict perspectives. The project is assessed not have major environment and climate impact but environment and climate will be part of the dialogue with RFSU and its implementing partners.</narrative>
  </description>
